as read but content compacted; paper defaults are β=2.0, γ_β_ratio=0.5 — implementation uses `self.beta`/`self.gamma_beta_ratio` regardless, so only verification is needed).\n- Whether `workspace/SimPO/scripts/` has an `__init__.py` (test imports `from scripts.simpo_trainer import ...`).\n- Whether `loss.npz` is writable and copyable to `workspace/loss.npz` given the sandbox's absolute-path restrictions.",
